["<aside class=\"callout why\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Why it matters</div><p>One planned range day turns a new rifle into your rifle: zeroed, the load picked, your real range known, and every step written down.</p></aside><figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 376\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A range day of about three hours: 1, in orange, arrive, learn the range rules and the firing line, load check; 2 at 15 minutes get on paper at 25 m; 3 zero at 100 m with 3 shot groups; 4 load test, 3 groups of each load; 5 field positions, sitting, kneeling, sticks; 6 the plate test; 7, in orange, unload, prove it, clean and log. Let the barrel cool between groups.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"376\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">The range day, about 3 hours</text><line x1=\"74\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"74\" y2=\"314\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"74\" cy=\"50\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"74\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">1</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">0:00</text><text x=\"94\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Arrive. Rules, firing line, load check</text><circle cx=\"74\" cy=\"94\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"74\" y=\"99\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">2</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"99\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">0:15</text><text x=\"94\" y=\"99\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Irons or scope: 25 m to get on paper</text><circle cx=\"74\" cy=\"138\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"74\" y=\"143\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">3</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"143\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">0:30</text><text x=\"94\" y=\"143\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Zero at 100 m: 3 shot groups</text><circle cx=\"74\" cy=\"182\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"74\" y=\"187\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">4</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"187\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">1:15</text><text x=\"94\" y=\"187\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Load test: 3 groups each load</text><circle cx=\"74\" cy=\"226\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"74\" y=\"231\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">5</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"231\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">1:45</text><text x=\"94\" y=\"231\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Field positions: sit, kneel, sticks</text><circle cx=\"74\" cy=\"270\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"74\" y=\"275\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">6</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"275\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">2:15</text><text x=\"94\" y=\"275\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Plate test from each position</text><circle cx=\"74\" cy=\"314\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"74\" y=\"319\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">7</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"319\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">2:45</text><text x=\"94\" y=\"319\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Unload, prove it, clean, log</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"330\" width=\"376\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#DCE3D6\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"352\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Cool barrel between groups (Tip).</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>About 3 hours, 7 blocks (Tip).</li><li>Start and end with a load check <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: what this chapter covers</summary><ul><li>The kit list, the timeline, the target sheet, the zero card, range safety, and what to do after.</li><li>It pulls together chapters 2 to 7: <a href=\"#/s/mc-tikka-02\">safety</a>, <a href=\"#/s/mc-tikka-03\">irons</a>, <a href=\"#/s/mc-tikka-04\">scope</a>, <a href=\"#/s/mc-tikka-05\">drills</a>, <a href=\"#/s/mc-tikka-06\">ammunition</a>, <a href=\"#/s/mc-tikka-07\">cleaning</a>.</li><li>General sighting in and the ranges near you: <a href=\"#/s/sighting-in/0\">Sighting in</a>. The Mission and District Rod and Gun Club has rifle boards at 25, 50, 100 and 200 m (65%, that lesson). Hours and guest rules: <span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span> on the club site.</li><li>Previous: <a href=\"#/s/mc-tikka-09\">Upgrades</a>. Back to the start: <a href=\"#/s/mc-tikka-01\">Parts and controls</a>.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 412\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Range day kit: 1 rifle unloaded and cased; 2 two test loads, one box each; 3, in orange, eye and ear protection; 4 a rest or bags, sticks and your pack; 5 targets, stapler and marker; 6 binoculars or a spotting scope; 7 screwdriver, Torx bits and torque driver; 8 snap caps and a cleaning rod; 9 your licence, journal and pen. Ammunition kept separate from the rifle in transit.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"412\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Range day kit</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"40\" width=\"376\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"55\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">1</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Rifle, bolt in, empty, cased</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"76\" width=\"376\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"91\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"96\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">2</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"96\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">2 test loads, 1 box each</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"112\" width=\"376\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"127\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"132\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">3</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"132\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Eye and ear protection</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"148\" width=\"376\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"163\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"168\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">4</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"168\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Rest or bags, sticks, pack</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"184\" width=\"376\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"199\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"204\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">5</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"204\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Targets, stapler, marker</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"220\" width=\"376\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"235\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"240\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">6</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"240\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Binoculars or spotting scope</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"256\" width=\"376\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"271\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"276\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">7</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"276\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Screwdriver, Torx, torque</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"292\" width=\"376\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"307\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"312\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">8</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"312\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Snap caps, cleaning rod</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"328\" width=\"376\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"343\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"348\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">9</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"348\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Firearms licence, journal, pen</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"368\" width=\"376\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#DCE3D6\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"389\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Ammunition separate from the rifle in transit.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Eye and ear protection for you and anyone near you <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li></ul><ul><li>Two test loads, one box each (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: why each item</summary><ul><li>\"Always wear protective glasses and earplugs whenever you shoot, and make sure that persons close to you are similarly protected\" (95%, Tikka manual page 10).</li><li>Snap caps for warm up dry fire at the bench (95%, page 9).</li><li>Torx bits and a torque driver: if a screw is loose, fix it to the right number on the spot (Tip; numbers in <a href=\"#/s/mc-tikka-04\">chapter 4</a>).</li><li>Your firearms licence: the PAL (Possession and Acquisition Licence) is shown at club sign up (70%, <a href=\"#/s/sighting-in/0\">sighting in</a>).</li><li>Transport: unloaded, chamber and magazine empty, in the vehicle (99%, <a href=\"#/s/mc-tikka-08\">chapter 8</a>). Cased and ammunition separate is the good habit (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<div class=\"checklist\" data-list=\"tk-range-kit-list\"><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"tk-range-kit-list:0\"><span>Rifle unloaded, cased, bolt in</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"tk-range-kit-list:1\"><span>Two test loads, one box each, lot numbers written</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"tk-range-kit-list:2\"><span>Eye and ear protection, spare plugs for a partner</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"tk-range-kit-list:3\"><span>Rest or sandbags, shooting sticks, pack</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"tk-range-kit-list:4\"><span>Targets, stapler, marker, tape</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"tk-range-kit-list:5\"><span>Binoculars or spotting scope</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"tk-range-kit-list:6\"><span>Screwdriver, Torx bits, torque driver</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"tk-range-kit-list:7\"><span>Snap caps, cleaning rod, rag</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"tk-range-kit-list:8\"><span>Firearms licence, journal, pen</span></label></div>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 376\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A range day of about three hours: 1, in orange, arrive, learn the range rules and the firing line, load check; 2 at 15 minutes get on paper at 25 m; 3 zero at 100 m with 3 shot groups; 4 load test, 3 groups of each load; 5 field positions, sitting, kneeling, sticks; 6 the plate test; 7, in orange, unload, prove it, clean and log. Let the barrel cool between groups.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"376\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">The range day, about 3 hours</text><line x1=\"74\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"74\" y2=\"314\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"74\" cy=\"50\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"74\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">1</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">0:00</text><text x=\"94\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Arrive. Rules, firing line, load check</text><circle cx=\"74\" cy=\"94\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"74\" y=\"99\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">2</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"99\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">0:15</text><text x=\"94\" y=\"99\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Irons or scope: 25 m to get on paper</text><circle cx=\"74\" cy=\"138\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"74\" y=\"143\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">3</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"143\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">0:30</text><text x=\"94\" y=\"143\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Zero at 100 m: 3 shot groups</text><circle cx=\"74\" cy=\"182\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"74\" y=\"187\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">4</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"187\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">1:15</text><text x=\"94\" y=\"187\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Load test: 3 groups each load</text><circle cx=\"74\" cy=\"226\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"74\" y=\"231\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">5</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"231\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">1:45</text><text x=\"94\" y=\"231\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Field positions: sit, kneel, sticks</text><circle cx=\"74\" cy=\"270\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"74\" y=\"275\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">6</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"275\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">2:15</text><text x=\"94\" y=\"275\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Plate test from each position</text><circle cx=\"74\" cy=\"314\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"74\" y=\"319\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">7</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"319\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">2:45</text><text x=\"94\" y=\"319\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Unload, prove it, clean, log</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"330\" width=\"376\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#DCE3D6\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"352\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Cool barrel between groups (Tip).</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Get on paper close, then zero at 100 m <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>Finish from field positions, not the bench (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: each block in detail</summary><ol><li><strong>Arrive:</strong> read the range rules; learn the cease fire call; load check at the firing line only (95% load check, page 8; range rules Tip).</li><li><strong>On paper:</strong> bore sight at 25 to 30 m, bolt out (95%, page 12). Then one shot, then a group.</li><li><strong>Zero at 100 m:</strong> 3 shot groups from a solid rest; adjust to the group centre; repeat; one confirm group (95%, page 12). Irons: 7 mm a click. Scope: read the turret.</li><li><strong>Load test:</strong> 3 groups of 3 with each load. Keep the tighter one that feeds and ejects cleanly (95% for testing function, page 9; group choice Tip).</li><li><strong>Field positions:</strong> sitting with sticks, kneeling, standing on a post. 5 shots each at 100 m (Tip).</li><li><strong>Plate test:</strong> 5 shots per position per distance (Tip, <a href=\"#/s/mc-tikka-05\">chapter 5</a>).</li><li><strong>Finish:</strong> unload, prove it, case it. Clean that night (95%, page 18).</li><li>Barrel heat: let it cool between groups; a hot barrel can shift shots (Tip, <a href=\"#/s/sighting-in/0\">sighting in</a>).</li><li>Any change in sound, a sticky bolt, a flattened or leaking primer: stop shooting (95%, page 19).</li></ol></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 376\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"One target sheet with five bulls: 1 group 1 and 2 group 2 for the zero, 3 a confirm group after the last adjustment, 4 a group with load B, and 5, in orange, the cold bore shot, the first shot from a cold, clean barrel next time. Write the load, distance, position and clicks beside each group and photograph it.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"376\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">One sheet, five bulls</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"42\" width=\"320\" height=\"260\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"106\" r=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"106\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><circle cx=\"72\" cy=\"76\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"72\" y=\"81\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">1</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Group 1</text><circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"106\" r=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"106\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><circle cx=\"252\" cy=\"76\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"252\" y=\"81\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">2</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Group 2</text><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"172\" r=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"172\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><circle cx=\"162\" cy=\"142\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"162\" y=\"147\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">3</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"218\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Confirm</text><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"238\" r=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"238\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><circle cx=\"72\" cy=\"208\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"72\" y=\"213\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">4</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"284\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Load B</text><circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"238\" r=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"238\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><circle cx=\"252\" cy=\"208\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"252\" y=\"213\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">5</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"284\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Cold bore</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"312\" width=\"376\" height=\"52\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#DCE3D6\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"334\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Write load, distance, position and clicks</text><text x=\"24\" y=\"352\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">beside each group. Photo it for the log.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Two zero groups, a confirm group, load B, and a cold bore bull (Tip).</li><li>Write the details beside each group (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: how to use the sheet</summary><ul><li>Bull 1 and 2: zero groups. Write the clicks you made between them (Tip).</li><li>Bull 3: the confirm group after the last adjustment (95%, the manual says repeat until the group is near the bull).</li><li>Bull 4: the second load, same aim point (Tip).</li><li>Bull 5: keep it blank. Next range day, your very first shot from a cold, clean barrel goes here. That is your hunting shot (Tip). The manual says a cleaned .22 bore needs a few rounds to settle; whether your .308 shifts on the first shot after cleaning is something only this bull tells you (Tip).</li><li>Photograph the sheet for the journal (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 384\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Your zero card: 1 rifle, Tikka T3x Arctic .308 Winchester; 2 sights, irons or which scope; 3 load and lot number; 4, in orange, zero distance and date; 5 clicks from bore sight; 6 plate test limits sitting, kneeling, standing; 7 next check before every hunt. Tape a copy in the case lid.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"384\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Your zero card</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"42\" width=\"376\" height=\"36\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"60\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">1</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Rifle</text><text x=\"380\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"end\">Tikka T3x Arctic .308 Win</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"84\" width=\"376\" height=\"36\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"102\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"107\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">2</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"107\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Sights</text><text x=\"380\" y=\"107\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"end\">irons / scope: ______</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"126\" width=\"376\" height=\"36\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"144\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"149\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">3</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"149\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Load and lot</text><text x=\"380\" y=\"149\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"end\">__________ gr ______</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"168\" width=\"376\" height=\"36\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"186\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"191\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">4</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"191\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Zero</text><text x=\"380\" y=\"191\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"end\">100 m, date ________</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"210\" width=\"376\" height=\"36\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"228\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"233\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">5</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"233\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Clicks from bore sight</text><text x=\"380\" y=\"233\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"end\">up ___ right ___</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"252\" width=\"376\" height=\"36\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"270\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"275\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">6</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"275\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Plate test limits</text><text x=\"380\" y=\"275\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"end\">sit ___ kneel ___ stand ___</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"294\" width=\"376\" height=\"36\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"312\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"317\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">7</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"317\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Next check</text><text x=\"380\" y=\"317\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"end\">before every hunt</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"340\" width=\"376\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#DCE3D6\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"361\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Tape a copy in the rifle case lid (Tip).</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Load, lot, zero distance, date (Tip).</li><li>Plate test limits per position (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: what goes on it and why</summary><ul><li>Rifle and sights: irons or which scope (Tip).</li><li>Load and lot number: a new lot can shift the zero (Tip).</li><li>Zero distance and date (Tip).</li><li>Clicks from bore sight: lets you get back fast if a scope is knocked or a sight refitted (Tip).</li><li>Plate test limits from <a href=\"#/s/mc-tikka-05\">chapter 5</a>: your personal maximum range from each position (Tip).</li><li>Next check: before every hunt, a few shots to confirm zero (Tip). After any fall, flight or rough ride: confirm (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 412\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Range day kit: 1 rifle unloaded and cased; 2 two test loads, one box each; 3, in orange, eye and ear protection; 4 a rest or bags, sticks and your pack; 5 targets, stapler and marker; 6 binoculars or a spotting scope; 7 screwdriver, Torx bits and torque driver; 8 snap caps and a cleaning rod; 9 your licence, journal and pen. Ammunition kept separate from the rifle in transit.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"412\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Range day kit</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"40\" width=\"376\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"55\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">1</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Rifle, bolt in, empty, cased</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"76\" width=\"376\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"91\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"96\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">2</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"96\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">2 test loads, 1 box each</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"112\" width=\"376\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"127\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"132\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">3</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"132\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Eye and ear protection</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"148\" width=\"376\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"163\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"168\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">4</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"168\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Rest or bags, sticks, pack</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"184\" width=\"376\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"199\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"204\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">5</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"204\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Targets, stapler, marker</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"220\" width=\"376\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"235\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"240\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">6</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"240\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Binoculars or spotting scope</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"256\" width=\"376\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"271\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"276\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">7</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"276\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Screwdriver, Torx, torque</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"292\" width=\"376\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"307\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"312\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">8</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"312\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Snap caps, cleaning rod</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"328\" width=\"376\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"343\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"348\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">9</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"348\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Firearms licence, journal, pen</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"368\" width=\"376\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#DCE3D6\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"389\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Ammunition separate from the rifle in transit.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Clean tonight <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>Log rounds fired, groups, limits (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the evening routine</summary><ul><li>Routine clean from <a href=\"#/s/mc-tikka-07\">chapter 7</a>: rust can start within 24 hours (95%, page 18).</li><li>Check the receiver screws and ring screws (95%, page 18 for receiver screws).</li><li>Write the zero card. Put a copy in the case (Tip).</li><li>Count the remaining rounds of your chosen load. Buy 3 more boxes of the same lot (Tip, <a href=\"#/s/mc-tikka-06\">chapter 6</a>).</li><li>Add the session to the app's journal and the My guns log (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 376\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"One target sheet with five bulls: 1 group 1 and 2 group 2 for the zero, 3 a confirm group after the last adjustment, 4 a group with load B, and 5, in orange, the cold bore shot, the first shot from a cold, clean barrel next time. Write the load, distance, position and clicks beside each group and photograph it.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"376\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">One sheet, five bulls</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"42\" width=\"320\" height=\"260\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"106\" r=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"106\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><circle cx=\"72\" cy=\"76\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"72\" y=\"81\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">1</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Group 1</text><circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"106\" r=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"106\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><circle cx=\"252\" cy=\"76\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"252\" y=\"81\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">2</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Group 2</text><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"172\" r=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"172\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><circle cx=\"162\" cy=\"142\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"162\" y=\"147\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">3</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"218\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Confirm</text><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"238\" r=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"238\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><circle cx=\"72\" cy=\"208\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"72\" y=\"213\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">4</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"284\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Load B</text><circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"238\" r=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"238\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><circle cx=\"252\" cy=\"208\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"252\" y=\"213\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">5</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"284\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Cold bore</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"312\" width=\"376\" height=\"52\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#DCE3D6\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"334\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Write load, distance, position and clicks</text><text x=\"24\" y=\"352\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">beside each group. Photo it for the log.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li><strong>\"Close, then far.\"</strong> 25 m on paper, then 100 m.</li><li><strong>\"Bench to zero, field to learn.\"</strong></li><li><strong>\"Log it or lose it.\"</strong></li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: mistakes, rule and the field task</summary><ul><li><strong>Old hand's rule</strong> (opinion): \"The range is where you make mistakes cheaply.\"</li></ul><aside class=\"callout mistake\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Common mistakes</div><ul><li>Chasing one flyer shot with the turrets.</li><li>Shooting only from the bench and calling it ready.</li><li>Leaving without writing the load, lot and clicks down.</li></ul></aside><aside class=\"callout field\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Do this in the field</div><p>Book the range day this week. Print this chapter's target sheet idea on plain paper with 5 bulls, and fill the zero card the same evening.</p></aside></details>","<ul><li>Tikka manual <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>. Range details from the sighting in lesson (65 to 70%). Plan and habits: Tip. Checked 2026-10-23.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: all sources</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://media.sako.global/image/upload/v1691658741/Tikka_T1x_T3x_Instruction_Manual_v5.3_cjggnu.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Tikka T1x and T3x instruction manual v5.3 (PDF)</a>: load check (page 8), ammunition and snap caps (page 9), protection and loading (page 10), sighting in (page 12), cleaning (page 18), warning signs (page 19). Read directly 2026-10-23 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span></li><li>Hunt Mentor: <a href=\"#/s/sighting-in/0\">Sighting in</a> (ranges, 65 to 70%), <a href=\"#/s/field-positions/0\">field positions</a>, <a href=\"#/s/season-practice/0\">season practice</a></li></ul></details>"]